WEBVTT

00:00:09.208 --> 00:00:10.833
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:10.833 --> 00:00:12.792
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:16.208 --> 00:00:17.792
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:17.792 --> 00:00:19.625
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:00:21.292 --> 00:00:23.292
<i>Shake it love, YES!</i>

00:00:23.292 --> 00:00:26.833
<i>I'm going crazy with longing</i>

00:00:26.833 --> 00:00:28.458
<i>Brushing back my hair</i>

00:00:28.458 --> 00:00:30.500
<i>That got wet in an instant</i>

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:33.167
<i>Being toyed with by the warm rain</i>

00:00:33.167 --> 00:00:36.667
<i>Shall I see how far I can run?</i>

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.625
<i>The prayer</i>

00:00:38.625 --> 00:00:40.625
<i>That spun out</i>

00:00:40.625 --> 00:00:43.542
<i>Connects to the future</i>

00:00:43.542 --> 00:00:44.458
<i>Overflowing</i>

00:00:44.458 --> 00:00:45.958
<i>The miracle of love</i>

00:00:45.958 --> 00:00:47.875
<i>The wonderful miracle</i>

00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.667
<i>The voice of these six flowers</i>

00:00:50.667 --> 00:00:52.875
<i>is released! (Shake it love, SAY!)</i>

00:00:52.875 --> 00:00:54.708
<i>Pulling toward each other (So fast!)</i>

00:00:54.708 --> 00:00:56.375
<i>That power (So vast!)</i>

00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:58.667
<i>I want it to reach you</i>

00:00:58.667 --> 00:00:59.958
<i>Don't stop the music</i>

00:00:59.958 --> 00:01:01.792
<i>High in the night sky (So high!)</i>

00:01:01.792 --> 00:01:03.875
<i>I send up my excitement (Turn round!)</i>

00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:06.333
<i>Gravitic-romantic</i>

00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:07.125
<i>Tonight</i>

00:01:07.125 --> 00:01:08.792
<i>Can't be stopped (Nonstop!)</i>

00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:10.625
<i>The impulse of love (Get down!)</i>

00:01:10.625 --> 00:01:13.750
<i>I want to mess you up</i>

00:01:13.750 --> 00:01:15.458
<i>T-T-Take it easy now!</i>

00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:17.083
<i>To embrace you</i>

00:01:17.083 --> 00:01:18.750
<i>a-a-as I feel it</i>

00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:19.500
<i>Let's dance</i>

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:22.750
<i>And once you're captivated, kiss!</i>

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:24.500
<i>Good love! Good love!</i>

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.875
<i>Gravitic-love!</i>

00:01:26.875 --> 00:01:28.667
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:01:28.667 --> 00:01:30.583
<i>Shakin', sugar, sugar!</i>

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:34.042
<i>Shake it love, YES!</i>

00:01:38.375 --> 00:01:43.167
"A Chance Encounter with the Past"

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:49.875
In the beginning of summer,

00:01:49.875 --> 00:01:53.833
when <i>Tanabata </i>is close, I remember...

00:01:53.833 --> 00:01:58.167
...my first love, who died when she was young.

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:02.375
The days I visited her in the hospital...

00:02:02.375 --> 00:02:06.042
The day we wrote our wishes on
<i>tanzaku </i>strips together...

00:02:06.042 --> 00:02:09.833
The one time we went to
the shrine festival in secret...

00:02:14.000 --> 00:02:18.625
The vague, indistinct memories of childhood...

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:25.125
But even now, I can remember
them clearly in my dreams...

00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:41.750
Rui, what wish will you write?

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:44.417
I'm still thinking. What will you write, Ikkun?

00:02:44.417 --> 00:02:46.333
Hey!

00:02:46.333 --> 00:02:47.333
Kai.

00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.167
Oh, good morning, Kai!

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:54.125
It's unusual for you two to wake up before me.

00:02:55.125 --> 00:02:56.875
It's been a while since I've had
to go out of town for filming,

00:02:56.875 --> 00:02:58.833
so I couldn't sleep!

00:02:58.833 --> 00:03:01.167
Will you write your wish on a <i>tanzaku</i>, too, Kai?

00:03:03.542 --> 00:03:05.917
No, I'm okay.

00:03:07.458 --> 00:03:10.208
You two should come back
and get ready soon, too.

00:03:10.208 --> 00:03:12.208
Mr. Kurotsuki'll be here soon!

00:03:12.208 --> 00:03:13.625
Okay!

00:03:17.208 --> 00:03:18.792
So it's<i> Tanabata</i>, huh?

00:03:20.167 --> 00:03:22.667
No wonder I had that dream.

00:03:45.583 --> 00:03:47.750
Hey, how do you do?

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.375
We're Procella!

00:03:49.375 --> 00:03:54.250
Let's get started! What do you all
think of when you think of summer?

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:55.792
The beach!

00:03:55.792 --> 00:03:59.000
It's hot... It's really hot...

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:00.125
Häagen-Da--

00:04:00.125 --> 00:04:02.250
You can't say the brand name!

00:04:04.292 --> 00:04:07.042
Well, none of those are wrong,

00:04:07.042 --> 00:04:10.542
but the "summer" we want
to recommend today is this!

00:04:10.542 --> 00:04:12.625
A haunted house!

00:04:12.625 --> 00:04:14.542
Oh, it's big.

00:04:14.542 --> 00:04:15.542
That's right!

00:04:15.542 --> 00:04:19.083
The pride of this amusement park
and Japan's largest haunted house,

00:04:19.083 --> 00:04:21.833
"The Time Maze" is the hot new attraction

00:04:21.833 --> 00:04:24.083
delivering a fresh fear experience!

00:04:24.083 --> 00:04:28.208
A walk of about 800 meters
that takes a whole hour!

00:04:28.208 --> 00:04:31.792
A historical Showa-style town has
been recreated inside the large building,

00:04:31.792 --> 00:04:36.083
and it's hard to tell if
you're inside or outside!

00:04:36.083 --> 00:04:39.542
That mental uneasiness is
part of what's so great about it!

00:04:39.542 --> 00:04:41.167
"Tanaka Clinic"
The old estate at the exit is

00:04:41.167 --> 00:04:44.208
"Tanaka Clinic"
an actual building from the area

00:04:44.208 --> 00:04:45.583
"Tanaka Clinic"
with an <i>interesting </i>history,

00:04:45.583 --> 00:04:48.083
"Tanaka Clinic"
relocated to be used in this maze.

00:04:48.083 --> 00:04:51.333
"Tanaka Clinic"
It's supposed to be the scariest spot!

00:04:51.333 --> 00:04:53.250
"Tanaka Clinic"

00:04:53.250 --> 00:04:54.833
An interesting history?

00:04:54.833 --> 00:05:00.333
Yes, according to rumors, the ghost
of a girl who died of loneliness

00:05:00.333 --> 00:05:07.583
is still wandering the place,
waiting for someone to come for her.

00:05:07.583 --> 00:05:11.042
Oh, she's a veteran at housesitting.

00:05:11.042 --> 00:05:12.833
She's not housesitting.

00:05:12.833 --> 00:05:14.667
This has hints of the occult, huh?

00:05:14.667 --> 00:05:16.833
I'm a little interested now.

00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:19.625
This guy's already really into it,

00:05:19.625 --> 00:05:22.958
but I don't think this was
the reaction they were going for.

00:05:22.958 --> 00:05:29.917
And so, we will now experience
this giant maze for ourselves!

00:05:29.917 --> 00:05:32.000
Everyone, let's do our best!

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:34.042
Yeah!

00:05:34.042 --> 00:05:35.417
Cut!

00:05:35.417 --> 00:05:38.542
Opening's done!
We'll stop the cameras for now.

00:05:39.792 --> 00:05:42.000
Good work, everyone!

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:42.375
Here.

00:05:42.375 --> 00:05:44.750
Thank you, Mr. Kurotsuki.

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.083
Rui, are you okay with this heat?

00:05:47.083 --> 00:05:50.625
Yeah, it's cooler than Tokyo, so I'm fine.

00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:53.583
Rui, you look like you'd be fine
with scary stuff, too.

00:05:53.583 --> 00:05:57.167
Yeah. I like mysterious things.

00:05:57.167 --> 00:05:58.500
I'm looking forward to it.

00:05:58.500 --> 00:06:00.500
I'm half and half, I think.

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:06.917
It's kind of scary, but it's also exciting
to think that a real ghost might appear!

00:06:07.875 --> 00:06:10.167
All our kids are so strong.

00:06:10.167 --> 00:06:13.125
I feel like something's missing, though.

00:06:13.125 --> 00:06:16.292
In order to film a shot with me
comforting the two of you

00:06:16.292 --> 00:06:19.625
with tears in your eyes from fear,

00:06:19.625 --> 00:06:22.417
is there something I should do?

00:06:22.417 --> 00:06:23.583
Huh?!

00:06:23.583 --> 00:06:26.000
I'm asking you nicely. Please don't.

00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:32.792
But no one in Procella seems like
they'd be bothered by this type of stuff.

00:06:32.792 --> 00:06:35.250
I mean, You grew up in a temple.

00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:37.958
He looks like he could perform exorcisms.

00:06:37.958 --> 00:06:39.083
I know what you mean!

00:06:39.083 --> 00:06:41.500
If You hears that, he'd probably get mad.

00:06:41.500 --> 00:06:43.208
Huh?

00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:48.000
Excuse me! The lights seem to be...

00:06:48.000 --> 00:06:50.292
Did you make sure to change the battery?

00:06:50.292 --> 00:06:52.500
Of course!

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:56.250
Um, the boom mic seems
to be having trouble, too.

00:06:56.250 --> 00:06:59.083
There have been strange noises
coming out of it for a while.

00:06:59.083 --> 00:07:00.083
Huh?

00:07:00.083 --> 00:07:01.375
What about the lapel mics?

00:07:01.375 --> 00:07:03.167
Those seem okay.

00:07:03.167 --> 00:07:04.958
I-Is this...

00:07:04.958 --> 00:07:07.542
...what they call a "paranormal phenomenon"?

00:07:07.542 --> 00:07:08.542
Huh?

00:07:08.542 --> 00:07:10.792
Calm down, you two.

00:07:10.792 --> 00:07:13.208
They're just having some
problems with the equipment.

00:07:13.208 --> 00:07:16.458
What? But look at the timing of it!

00:07:16.458 --> 00:07:18.083
I'm getting excited.

00:07:19.292 --> 00:07:21.958
You're all so reliable.

00:07:35.125 --> 00:07:37.125
Kai?

00:07:37.125 --> 00:07:38.542
What's wrong?

00:07:38.542 --> 00:07:41.333
I-It's nothing.

00:07:41.333 --> 00:07:42.667
Hm...

00:07:42.667 --> 00:07:46.083
Thanks for waiting.
We'll start filming again now!

00:07:46.083 --> 00:07:47.875
Oh, okay!

00:07:53.208 --> 00:07:55.375
Okay, have a good time.

00:07:55.375 --> 00:07:58.833
Be careful, Rui. Don't wander away from Kai!

00:07:58.833 --> 00:08:00.292
I won't.

00:08:00.292 --> 00:08:02.417
Well, we'll go first then.

00:08:02.417 --> 00:08:03.750
All right, let's go.

00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.167
Okay.

00:08:14.250 --> 00:08:15.667
Wow...

00:08:20.417 --> 00:08:22.917
"Open"

00:08:24.208 --> 00:08:28.625
Wow, it's like we went back in time.

00:08:28.625 --> 00:08:31.292
Kai, which way do you want to go?

00:08:31.292 --> 00:08:33.458
Let's see, the route goes...

00:08:43.333 --> 00:08:46.292
K-Kai? Wait up!

00:08:55.792 --> 00:08:57.208
Huh?

00:09:32.750 --> 00:09:35.917
What's wrong with me?
I'm in the middle of work.

00:09:35.917 --> 00:09:39.375
I can't believe I'd remember
that day right now...

00:09:42.542 --> 00:09:44.458
Huh? H-Hey!

00:09:56.208 --> 00:09:58.042
What's wrong, miss?

00:09:58.042 --> 00:10:00.333
Are you lost?

00:10:00.333 --> 00:10:01.750
Hm?

00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:10.500
Anyway, let's get out of here.

00:10:10.500 --> 00:10:13.458
There should be an emergency exit
around where you can get out early.

00:10:18.833 --> 00:10:21.417
It's all right. Don't worry.

00:10:21.417 --> 00:10:25.208
Once we get outside,
I'll help you find your parents.

00:10:25.208 --> 00:10:29.625
I used to be a jack-of-all-trades,
so I'm a pro at finding things.

00:10:29.625 --> 00:10:32.792
Now, let's find the exit...

00:10:32.792 --> 00:10:34.208
Hm?

00:10:38.875 --> 00:10:41.417
Is that... the exit?

00:10:42.625 --> 00:10:44.042
Then let's go.

00:11:08.917 --> 00:11:12.250
Mr. Shimotsuki,
Mr. Kannaduki, please get ready.

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:13.167
Okay!

00:11:13.167 --> 00:11:18.833
Ikkun, if you get scared, feel <i>free</i>
to jump into my arms whenever you want!

00:11:18.833 --> 00:11:20.833
I told you, I'll be fine.

00:11:20.833 --> 00:11:24.917
Anyway, with your demon king
aura in front of their eyes,

00:11:24.917 --> 00:11:27.250
I feel like even a ghost would run away.

00:11:29.708 --> 00:11:32.167
Hey, wait! You can't come out
from the entrance!

00:11:32.167 --> 00:11:34.333
I'm sorry!

00:11:34.333 --> 00:11:36.583
Rui!

00:11:36.583 --> 00:11:38.000
What's wrong?

00:11:38.000 --> 00:11:39.583
Oh? Where's Kai?

00:11:39.583 --> 00:11:41.458
He's gone.

00:11:41.458 --> 00:11:43.000
You wandered away from him?

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:44.500
No.

00:11:44.500 --> 00:11:48.375
He ran off suddenly,
like he was chasing something...

00:11:48.375 --> 00:11:50.833
I went to the end of the street
to look for him,

00:11:50.833 --> 00:11:52.417
but he was gone...

00:11:52.417 --> 00:11:53.833
Huh?

00:11:55.083 --> 00:11:58.958
Excuse me, but can we
stop filming for now?

00:11:58.958 --> 00:12:00.792
Y-Yes, of course.

00:12:02.083 --> 00:12:04.667
I'll go find him, so don't worry.

00:12:04.667 --> 00:12:08.667
Is there any park staff that
can show me around inside?

00:12:08.667 --> 00:12:10.083
Y-Yes.

00:12:14.458 --> 00:12:15.750
I'll go, too!

00:12:15.750 --> 00:12:17.917
Rui!

00:12:17.917 --> 00:12:19.292
Wait, Rui.

00:12:19.292 --> 00:12:21.125
No, Rui.

00:12:21.125 --> 00:12:22.750
You wait here.

00:12:22.750 --> 00:12:24.333
But...!

00:12:24.333 --> 00:12:27.542
Kai was a little strange this morning...

00:12:27.542 --> 00:12:30.667
That's why I'm worried...

00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:34.750
I'll go, too, Dai. Will that be all right?

00:12:34.750 --> 00:12:37.083
As the leader of Procellarum,

00:12:37.083 --> 00:12:42.208
I can't stand by silently if
one of my members is... lost.

00:12:43.250 --> 00:12:44.458
Shun...

00:12:44.458 --> 00:12:45.875
Shun...

00:12:47.958 --> 00:12:49.625
Fine.

00:12:49.625 --> 00:12:51.208
Iku, you wait here.

00:12:51.208 --> 00:12:54.250
Can you contact Tsukishiro just in case?

00:12:54.250 --> 00:12:56.792
Yes! Leave it to me.

00:12:56.792 --> 00:12:59.417
Shun and Rui, don't get separated from us.

00:13:01.417 --> 00:13:03.833
Okay. I'll show you the way.

00:13:03.833 --> 00:13:05.250
Please.

00:13:13.625 --> 00:13:15.833
We got separated around here.

00:13:15.833 --> 00:13:18.542
Kai went off toward those shrine grounds...

00:13:25.458 --> 00:13:28.708
Could he have gone out through
one of the emergency exits?

00:13:28.708 --> 00:13:31.792
No, there's no exit around here.

00:13:31.792 --> 00:13:33.917
There <i>is </i>one further ahead...

00:13:33.917 --> 00:13:37.583
I followed him right away,
so he couldn't have gotten very far.

00:13:37.583 --> 00:13:39.625
His footsteps stopped soon after, too.

00:13:39.625 --> 00:13:45.417
Maybe he left the path and got lost
in the blocked-off area under construction.

00:13:45.417 --> 00:13:47.333
That happens occasionally.

00:13:47.333 --> 00:13:49.083
That's...

00:13:49.083 --> 00:13:51.292
Isn't this bad?

00:13:51.292 --> 00:13:54.458
Let's do a large-scale search
of the whole building.

00:13:54.458 --> 00:13:56.375
Thank you. Please do.

00:14:07.542 --> 00:14:10.542
Are you feeling unwell?

00:14:10.542 --> 00:14:12.625
Did you sneak awa

00:14:12.625 --> 00:14:14.167
Uh-huh.

00:14:14.167 --> 00:14:16.250
I see...

00:14:16.250 --> 00:14:18.750
It feels kind of strange, doesn't it?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:21.250
I remember doing that, too.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:24.708
Well, I wasn't the one who snuck out,

00:14:24.708 --> 00:14:27.458
it was a friend of mine, a girl.

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:31.625
The summer when I was ten,

00:14:31.625 --> 00:14:34.917
my grandma out in the countryside got hurt.

00:14:34.917 --> 00:14:40.417
My parents took me to
visit her in a small hospital.

00:14:40.417 --> 00:14:44.958
Now that I think about it,
I think she was my first love.

00:14:44.958 --> 00:14:50.500
She had a serious illness and
couldn't even really leave her bed.

00:14:50.500 --> 00:14:54.167
But she smiled at me.

00:14:54.167 --> 00:14:58.375
Until my grandma's injury healed,
I visited the hospital every day

00:14:58.375 --> 00:15:01.292
and went to <i>her </i>room, too.

00:15:01.292 --> 00:15:04.792
Since she couldn't go outside,
I wanted to make her smile,

00:15:04.792 --> 00:15:06.500
so I talked to her about different things.

00:15:17.125 --> 00:15:19.333
Doctor, please hurry!

00:15:19.333 --> 00:15:20.250
What are her vitals?

00:15:20.250 --> 00:15:22.167
Her pulse and blood pressure are dropping.

00:15:22.167 --> 00:15:23.958
Her body temperature is dropping, too.

00:15:23.958 --> 00:15:25.042
She's losing consciousness.

00:15:25.042 --> 00:15:26.917
Doctor, we're ready.

00:15:26.917 --> 00:15:28.333
Okay.

00:15:40.625 --> 00:15:44.000
Oh, good. You managed to make it back, huh?

00:15:48.167 --> 00:15:50.375
You'll be okay by yourself now.

00:15:51.833 --> 00:15:53.250
Don't go.

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:57.667
Don't go.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.417
I see...

00:16:04.792 --> 00:16:07.042
You're...

00:16:07.042 --> 00:16:08.875
Fuduki!

00:16:08.875 --> 00:16:10.833
Mr. Fuduki!

00:16:10.833 --> 00:16:13.542
Kai! Kai, where are you?

00:16:15.542 --> 00:16:16.625
Shun.

00:16:16.625 --> 00:16:17.542
Did you hear that?

00:16:17.542 --> 00:16:18.958
Huh?

00:16:31.375 --> 00:16:34.458
Rui, go tell Dai and the others.

00:16:34.458 --> 00:16:36.000
Huh? Shun!

00:16:46.333 --> 00:16:49.000
Don't leave me alone.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:51.500
I want you to stay with me.

00:16:59.667 --> 00:17:01.750
Don't leave me alone...

00:17:04.833 --> 00:17:07.167
You were lonely, weren't you?

00:17:07.167 --> 00:17:11.000
Always by yourself in this hospital room...

00:17:11.000 --> 00:17:14.000
Is that why you brought me here?

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.667
Sorry, I...

00:17:16.667 --> 00:17:19.625
...couldn't tell you properly...

00:17:48.083 --> 00:17:49.333
Yeah...

00:17:49.333 --> 00:17:53.500
I always... wanted to see you one more time...

00:18:12.125 --> 00:18:15.292
Were you dreaming, Kai?

00:18:15.292 --> 00:18:19.792
It looks like part of it was a bad dream, huh?

00:18:19.792 --> 00:18:23.375
Is this... from earlier...?

00:18:23.375 --> 00:18:24.792
Huh?

00:18:31.667 --> 00:18:35.500
Shun, did you save me?

00:18:35.500 --> 00:18:38.208
No, it wasn't me.

00:18:38.208 --> 00:18:39.667
Kai, here.

00:18:45.125 --> 00:18:48.083
Oh, where was this?

00:18:48.083 --> 00:18:49.583
Someone gave it to me.

00:18:52.083 --> 00:18:53.375
Shun?

00:18:53.375 --> 00:18:54.792
Did you find Kai?

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:57.958
Time to head back.

00:18:57.958 --> 00:18:59.417
Let's go, Kai.

00:19:17.917 --> 00:19:21.375
Yes, I apologize. Please allow us to reschedule.

00:19:21.375 --> 00:19:25.292
Aw man, I was <i>seriously </i>worried!

00:19:25.292 --> 00:19:26.583
Sorry, sorry.

00:19:26.583 --> 00:19:29.792
Anyway, I'm fine. I wasn't hurt or anything.

00:19:29.792 --> 00:19:33.417
It looks like we'll restart filming tomorrow.

00:19:33.417 --> 00:19:35.500
Oh, but because of what happened today,

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:38.750
they said they might change
the featured attraction.

00:19:38.750 --> 00:19:39.792
I see...

00:19:39.792 --> 00:19:41.792
That's a little sad...

00:19:41.792 --> 00:19:44.417
Let's go to a haunted house
when we have some time off.

00:19:44.417 --> 00:19:45.417
Okay!

00:19:45.417 --> 00:19:47.625
I wonder when my next day off is...

00:19:47.625 --> 00:19:49.500
I hope we can find a day we're both off.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:50.750
Yeah.

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:55.375
"The Time Maze"
"Entrance"

00:19:55.875 --> 00:19:57.167
Shun!

00:19:57.167 --> 00:19:59.208
Shun, we're leaving.

00:19:59.208 --> 00:20:00.625
Okay!

00:20:04.750 --> 00:20:08.875
You were just lonely and wanted
someone to play with, huh?

00:20:08.875 --> 00:20:11.708
But you can't be naughty anymore.

00:20:19.333 --> 00:20:20.750
Thanks...

00:20:27.833 --> 00:20:30.542
You're staying another night? No fair!

00:20:30.542 --> 00:20:34.292
What're you saying? Kai had a tough time.

00:20:34.292 --> 00:20:36.333
Well, I'm glad he's okay, though.

00:20:36.333 --> 00:20:37.583
Yeah.

00:20:37.583 --> 00:20:40.042
We had crab for dinner.

00:20:40.042 --> 00:20:43.125
What?! What the hell! It is <i>too </i>not fair!

00:20:43.125 --> 00:20:46.000
Make sure you bring back
some of that crab, you hear?

00:20:46.000 --> 00:20:47.417
You...

00:20:51.833 --> 00:20:53.125
A wish?

00:20:53.125 --> 00:20:55.042
Yeah, well...

00:20:55.042 --> 00:20:57.208
Since we have the chance.

00:20:57.208 --> 00:21:04.000
I'm not Orihime or Hikoboshi,
but it's good to reminisce once a year.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:10.500
Oh? You're a romantic as usual, Kai.

00:21:10.500 --> 00:21:11.917
Leave me alone.

00:21:13.917 --> 00:21:17.250
By the way, what did you
write on your <i>tanzaku</i>?

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:21.708
Hm? That's... That's a secret.

00:21:21.708 --> 00:21:23.792
Huh?

00:21:23.792 --> 00:21:27.458
Don't worry about it.
Come on, let's go inside.

00:21:31.792 --> 00:21:36.542
"Thanks. I'll never forget you. -Kai"

00:22:02.417 --> 00:22:08.792
<i>I feel like someone is calling me</i>

00:22:08.792 --> 00:22:15.875
<i>Following the faint voice, I tried going along with it</i>

00:22:15.875 --> 00:22:19.292
<i>If there was meaning in that</i>

00:22:19.292 --> 00:22:22.708
<i>If you were there</i>

00:22:22.708 --> 00:22:30.583
<i>I was overflowing with feelings</i>
<i>of the changing seasons</i>

00:22:30.583 --> 00:22:37.458
<i>On the day when I was led to a row</i>
<i>of cherry trees and found you</i>

00:22:37.458 --> 00:22:44.542
<i>As I passed through,</i>
<i>the fragrance of spring caressed my chest</i>

00:22:44.542 --> 00:22:48.042
<i>Let's walk facing forward</i>

00:22:48.042 --> 00:22:51.417
<i>I'll be fine</i>

00:22:51.417 --> 00:22:56.083
<i>I'll pull your hand along</i>

00:22:56.083 --> 00:23:00.125
<i>Toward the brilliant future</i>

00:23:11.875 --> 00:23:12.792
"Episode 6: A Smart Detective!?"

00:23:12.792 --> 00:23:15.708
"Episode 6: A Smart Detective!?"
I'm Koi Kisaragi, or Koikku!

00:23:15.708 --> 00:23:17.042
"Episode 6: A Smart Detective!?"
All the Gravi and Procella

00:23:17.042 --> 00:23:19.125
"Episode 6: A Smart Detective!?"
members have come to this island

00:23:19.125 --> 00:23:21.042
"Episode 6: A Smart Detective!?"
to shoot a music video.

00:23:21.042 --> 00:23:23.375
"Episode 6: A Smart Detective!?"
We had fun and finished filming,

00:23:23.375 --> 00:23:27.583
so I wonder what we'll do
with the rest of our time?

00:23:27.583 --> 00:23:32.875
Hey... Huh? Haru? Haru...!

00:23:32.875 --> 00:23:35.458
Next time, "A Smart Detective!?"

00:23:35.458 --> 00:23:42.016
Leave it all to the great detective, Koikku!
